        "TileImage": "$($repository 90527ca8-b658-4b26-bc0a-9c7018881814).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. \rYour target is Ray Miller, Leader of the Miller Crime Syndicate, and his mistress, Angelina Kleiner.  Once one of Britain&apos;s most infamous crime lords, the Miller Syndicate was ultimately dissolved after crackdowns by the British authorities in the 90s.  Laying low since then, Miller has been reported to be staying at Hokkaido, seeking to change his appearance to get back in the game. His closest associates are also at the hospital, getting similar operations.\rGood luck, 47.",
